## What is vendored

The five environment-authoring skills and every reference file they ship: 14
files - four framework ports and the orchestrator that drives them from a
description. The entry point `skills/rl-env/SKILL.md` is tezgah's own and is not
part of the manifest; neither is this file. Upstream's own install route
(`npx skills add adithya-s-k/FineEnvs`) is not used: it writes into a host's
skill directory, which is outside tezgah's router, its install report and this
manifest.

